<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/16th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Ridaniya</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1517">1517</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a> · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-mamluk-war-1516-1517">Ottoman–Mamluk War (1516–1517)</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Ridaniya was fought on 22 January 1517 outside <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cairo">Cairo</a> between the Ottoman army of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/selim-i">Selim I</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mamluk">Mamluks</a> under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sultan">Sultan</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tuman-bay-ii">Tuman bay II</a>. Ottoman artillery and musketry outflanked the Mamluk fortified line, and Cairo was taken soon after. The victory completed the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-conquest-of-egypt">Ottoman conquest of Egypt</a> and ended the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mamluk-sultanate">Mamluk Sultanate</a>.</p></div>
